%% OpenLesson: life cycle of an open lesson (automation cycle, section 11 of the specification)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Draft schedule" as Draft
  state "Awaiting materials" as Awaiting
  state "Materials uploaded" as Uploaded
  state "Missed deadline" as Violation
  state "Collecting feedback" as Feedback

  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Awaiting: schedule approved
  Awaiting --> Uploaded: slides + plan uploaded
  Uploaded --> Confirmed: check at -7 days
  Awaiting --> Annulled: missed (auto policy)
  Awaiting --> Violation: missed (admin policy)
  Violation --> Confirmed: admin confirms / extends
  Violation --> Annulled: admin annuls
  Confirmed --> Held: lesson ends
  Held --> Feedback: attendance sheet confirmed
  Feedback --> Closed: +3 days, AI summary
  Closed --> [*]
  Annulled --> [*]

  note right of Confirmed
    reminders at -10 / -7 days,
    poster to all staff at -3 days
  end note
